# ASCIIwire DSL v2 Sample - Dashboard UI
@layout stack
  @component header
    Dashboard

  @layout split ratio=30/70
    @branch left
      @component nav
        [ Home ] [ Users ] [ Settings ] [ Reports ]

      @component panel height=8
        Menu Footer
        v1.0.0

    @branch right
      @layout stack
        @component panel height=5
          Welcome back, Admin
          Last login: 2026-06-30

        @layout split ratio=50/50
          @branch left
            @component panel height=6
              Statistics
              Users: 1,234
              Active: 567
              Revenue: $12k

          @branch right
            @component panel height=6
              Recent Activity
              - User login
              - File upload
              - Comment posted

        @component table
          | ID | User    | Role   | Status |
          |----|---------|--------|--------|
          | 1  | Alice   | Admin  | Active |
          | 2  | Bob     | Editor | Idle   |
          | 3  | Charlie | Viewer | Away   |

  @component footer
    v1.0.0 | (c) 2024 ASCIIwire
